{"id":"vod_bf_27411","vodId":"27411","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"亲吻姐姐","name_cn":"亲吻姐姐","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-28/cff68a3ba897b60cd40c0f5bc87beebc.jpg"},"summary":"住之江圭太是个临近高中升学考试的初中三年级男生。他在小时候由于父亲再婚，而和可爱的双胞胎姐妹·亚香和理香成为了姐弟。尽管没有血缘关系，三人也关系和睦地一同成长，但不知从何时开始，亚香和理香却似乎对圭太产生了恋情。看似是个认真的人、实际上是闷骚类型的亚香，以及虽然说话很冷淡、内在却很积极的理香。被两人所逼近的圭太，陷入了并非是由于应考学习所导致的、另一种意义上的困境。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:57:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qinwenjiejie/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinwenjiejie/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qinwenjiejie/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinwenjiejie/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinwenjiejie/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinwenjiejie/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qinwenjiejie/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinwenjiejie/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241031rOA1DqJrindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qinwenjiejie/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinwenjiejie/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241031Bo9AFSm0index.m3u8/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:20.500Z"}